    Upcoming board meeting notices and latest quarterly results from listed Indian companies.
    Sourced directly from NSE's official disclosure feed.
  </p>
  <span class="date-badge">📅 {today}</span>
</header>

<main class="page-wrap" id="main">

  <div class="cta-strip">
    <p>
      <strong>Own stocks affected by upcoming results?</strong><br>
      Arthavi tracks your full portfolio and shows impact of results on your XIRR and net worth in real time.
    </p>
    <a href="https://app.arthavi.com/register" id="bm-cta-top" class="btn-cta">Track My Portfolio Free →</a>
  </div>

  <!-- Tabs -->
